# Leyline Axe's opening-hand action is a "may", for each player who holds one (CR 103.6a): Bot1 declines, so the Axe stays in its
# hand and is an ordinary artifact it casts for {4} later (four Moxen on turn 1, the Axe on the battlefield afterwards); Bot2,
# asked after the starting player, accepts, and its own Axe is on its battlefield from the start.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline Axe
Mox Ruby
